; WHO 22 sound diffusion: WHAT values 36..54 and 60 on the amplifier 3#1#1 (*22*WHAT*3#1#1##).
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways: every value 36..54,
; and 60. WHAT 55, 56 and 57 are in sound-who22-what-55-57 and 58 / 59 in
; sound-who22-what-58-59. The MH202 does not answer WHAT 54 and 60 at all; the steps run in
; sorted order, so these two run last and no other step runs behind them.
;
; Result (stock settings, two identical runs per target, 13 targets): per group below, the
; gateways that forward the frame to the bus or answer it on the event session, the gateways
; whose daemon crashes, and the gateways that send no reply at all. Gateways not named drop the
; frame.
;
; ORACLE ONLY: frames of this file crash a daemon on at least one emulated gateway; do not send
; them to a real gateway.
;
; ORACLE ONLY: where a line below says 'no reply at all', the gateway sent neither ACK nor NACK
; for the frame, and in the emulator it can stop answering the frames that follow; do not send
; such a frame to a real gateway.

; 1. *22*N*3#1#1##
;    CRASH on 3488, F453, F453AV, F454, F459, F460, F461, MH200N, MH202, MyHomeServer1
